OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over death of
OL,4,A80-year-old man in Fife
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested following the
OL,7,Fdeath of an 80-year-old man in Fife.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FDunecht Court in Glenrothes at about
OL,11,F03:20 following a report of a seriously
OL,12,Finjured man.
OL,14,FThe 80-year-old was pronounced dead at
OL,15,Fthe scene and his family was made
OL,16,Faware.
OL,18,FPolice Scotland said a 22-year-old man
OL,19,Fwas arrested and inquiries are ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
